PocketSmart AI successfully demonstrates how Artificial Intelligence and modern web technologies can be combined to create a smart, personalized, and budget-friendly recommendation system. By integrating FastAPI with Gemini AI, the system can understand user requirements, analyze budgets and preferences, and provide relevant recommendations for different lifestyle needs such as home interiors, party planning, and jewelry selection.

The integration of multiple platforms enables users to explore suitable products and services while saving time and effort. The modular backend architecture provides scalability and efficient request handling, while the responsive frontend ensures a simple and user-friendly experience.

Overall, PocketSmart AI provides a practical solution for intelligent budget planning and personalized decision-making. The project highlights the potential of Generative AI to automate everyday planning tasks and deliver fast, context-aware, and cost-conscious recommendations. In the future, the system can be enhanced with real-time price tracking, advanced personalization, voice interaction, and improved recommendation accuracy.
